# Plan-file inspection depending on TensorRT's non-public layout; must not be published
tensorrt_cookbook/utils_private.py
# Its output is a field-by-field dump of that layout. `log-main.py.log` is pinned to the public view
# by the test config and is safe to commit; this one is not.
07-Tool/EnginePrinter/log-main.py-internal.log

# Download caches, deliberately not tracked - the whole directory, not just its contents, so a
# fresh clone starts from nothing and downloads everything once. They are a *local* accelerator
# that saves download time, not something the repository ships. Tracking them would put ~610 MB
# into git history permanently and would not help anyway - `/work` already survives the container
# resets that wipe the installed packages.
# The explanation lives in `dependence_packages.md`, which IS tracked, deliberately outside this
# directory so the directory can be ignored whole.
dependence_packages/

# Session progress notes, written for the maintainer to read between sessions. Deliberately local:
# it records what is half-finished right now, which is not something the repository should ship.
progress.md
